#tr.en: made a legal claim about (the portion of the field or the lack of procured labor?) 
>>Q000577 009
10. tukum-bi lugal-gu10 
#tr.en: If this  to my king,
>>Q000577 010
11. an-na-du10 
#tr.en: is amenable,
>>Q000577 011
12. ra-gaba hu-mu-un-gi4-gi4 
#tr.en: he should send a rider (to this effect) 
>>Q000577 012
