&P346265 = CDLI Literary 000582, ex. 004
#atf: lang sux 
@tablet 
@obverse 
1. [{d}]nin#-tin-ug5#?-ga agrig zi e2-kur-ra 
#tr.en: When to Nintinuga, the true steward of the Ekur temple, 
>>Q000582 001
